DESCRIPTION > Idempotency ledger tracking committed ingestion batches per CSV upload job

SCHEMA >
    `upload_id` UUID `json:$.upload_id`,
    `dataset_id` UUID `json:$.dataset_id`,
    `batch_id` UInt32 `json:$.batch_id`,
    `row_count` UInt32 `json:$.row_count`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "upload_id, batch_id"
